    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOccupying a commanding position overlooking the picturesque Vartry River, Leitrim Lodge is a distinguished mid-Victorian detached three-bay, two-storey residence of exceptional character and historical significance. This landmark home, extending to approximately 230 sq.m. (2,475 sq.ft.), is reputed to have been the former residence of the celebrated maritime pioneer Captain Robert Halpin, one of Ireland's most renowned seafarers.\n\nSet behind elegant cast-iron railings, the property enjoys an enviable location in the heart of Wicklow Town, offering immediate access to an excellent range of amenities while retaining a sense of privacy and grandeur synonymous with period homes of this calibre. Rich in architectural heritage, Leitrim Lodge retains a remarkable collection of original features that have been carefully preserved over the years, creating a home of immense warmth, charm and authenticity.\n\nUpon entering, one is immediately struck by the impressive proportions and elegant detailing throughout. The house showcases many fine Victorian features including high ceilings, ornate coving and cornicing, original timber window shutters, and beautiful period fireplaces, all of which combine to create interiors of timeless appeal. Large windows flood the accommodation with natural light, enhancing the generous scale and grandeur of each room.\n\nThe accommodation is both spacious and versatile, comprising three elegant reception rooms, each enjoying excellent proportions and period character. These beautifully appointed rooms provide the perfect setting for formal entertaining, family gatherings or tranquil relaxation, with many enjoying attractive views towards the river and surrounding townscape. Original fireplaces serve as focal points within these reception spaces, while the decorative plasterwork further highlights the craftsmanship of the Victorian era.\n\nThe bedroom accommodation is equally impressive, comprising five generously sized bedrooms providing comfortable and flexible accommodation for family living, guests or home-working requirements.\n\nComplementing the extensive accommodation are six bathrooms, offering excellent convenience and practicality for modern living while enhancing the versatility of the property.\n\nTo the rear of the residence lies a delightful west-facing courtyard, a private and sheltered outdoor space that enjoys afternoon and evening sunshine. This charming courtyard provides the ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining and relaxation, offering a peaceful retreat within the centre of town.\n\nLeitrim Lodge further benefits from on-street parking and occupies one of Wicklow Town's most desirable residential settings. The property's unrivalled location places residents within walking distance of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, Wicklow Harbour and a host of recreational amenities, while the scenic river outlook provides a constantly changing and attractive backdrop.\n\nSteeped in history and architectural elegance, Leitrim Lodge represents a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial Victorian residence of significant heritage. Combining period grandeur, original features, generous accommodation and a prime riverside location, this remarkable home stands as one of Wicklow Town's most distinctive and prestigious properties."
      },
